w: Je- sus wept! those tears are o- ver, But His heart is still the same;
w: When the pangs of tri- al seize us, When the waves of sor- row roll,
w: Je- sus wept! and still in glo- ry, He can mark each mourn- er’s tear;
w: Je- sus wept! that tear of sor- row Is a le- ga- cy of love;
w: Who is this in si- lence bend- ing O’er a dark se- pul- chral cave?
