w: Kin- sman, friend, and el- der bro- ther, Is His ev- er- last- ing name.
w: I will lay my head on Je- sus, Re- fuge of the troubl- ed soul.
w: Lo- ving to re- trace the sto- ry Of the hearts He so- laced here.
w: Yes- ter- day, to- day, to- mor- row, He the same doth ev- er prove,
w: Sym- pa- the- tic sor- row blen- ding With the tears a- round that grave?
