w: Sa- vior, who can love like Thee, Gra- cious One of Be- tha- ny?
w: Sure- ly, none can feel like Thee, Wee- ping One of Be- tha- ny!
w: Lord, when I am called to die, Let me think of Be- tha- ny.
w: Thou art all in all to me, Lo- ving One of Be- tha- ny!
w: Christ the Lord is stand- ing by, At the tomb of Be- tha- ny.
